  Credential custody (metadata only):
    Apply issues a durable agent credential stored in local managed configuration; offboard revokes it.
    subscription OAuth: local agent configuration, environment or credential store -> Preloop account model credential; import required: true
    Claude Code gateway disclosure (observed with v2.1.332): the banner says 'API Usage Billing' and, with a local login, warns that both claude.ai and ANTHROPIC_API_KEY are set. The API key here authenticates to Preloop.
    Your subscription usage still pays for model calls through this subscription-backed gateway route.
    With a custom ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL, /status reports that remote managed settings and organization policy are not fetched. claude.ai connectors are disabled under custom authentication. Team and Enterprise users: review this loss of cloud-delivered controls and connectors with your administrator before confirming enrollment.
    Preloop holds and rotates the live subscription refresh-token lineage. A config backup alone cannot restore subscription login. Offboard must write back the latest live lineage before cleanup; recovery failure stops cleanup. Run preloop agents offboard for the enrolled app while credential recovery is available.
